---
const checklistItems = [
  "Product type and intended application",
  "Drawings, dimensions, or rough measurements",
  "Reference photos, mood boards, or sketches",
  "Preferred stone material or target visual effect",
  "Surface finish, edge profile, and detail requirements",
  "Estimated quantity and target order stage",
  "Destination country or shipping requirements",
  "Special packing, labeling, or project-specific requests"
];
---

<section class="oem-quote-checklist section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="oem-quote-checklist__grid">
      <div class="oem-quote-checklist__media">
        <img
          src="/images/oem/oem-quote-checklist.jpg"
          alt="OEM stone quotation checklist and drawing review"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="oem-quote-checklist__content">
        <div class="oem-section-heading oem-section-heading--compact">
          <p class="oem-section-heading__eyebrow">
            What To Send For An OEM Quote
          </p>

          <h2>
            Share The Right Information
            For A Faster And More Accurate
            OEM Quotation
          </h2>

          <p>
            The more clearly we understand your product idea, technical needs,
            and shipping expectations, the easier it is to review feasibility,
            recommend suitable solutions, and prepare a more useful quotation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="oem-quote-checklist__card">
          <ul class="oem-quote-checklist__list">
            {checklistItems.map((item) => (
              <li>{item}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="oem-quote-checklist__note">
          Even if you don’t have complete technical drawings yet, you can still
          send rough dimensions, reference images, target materials, or sample
          ideas. We can help review the project and advise what additional
          information would be useful for production evaluation.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>